  "notable_quotes": [
    "Using C1-symmetric Hatz instead of C2-symmetric Hdatz changes the product from doubly interpenetrated pillar-layered MOFs to a noninterpenetrated framework with a helical Zn-triazolate chain.",
    "Unlike prior Zn/Hatz systems that tend to form Zn-triazolate layers, compound 1 is reported as the first MOF built from helical Zn-triazolate chain-like SBUs.",
    "Compound 1 forms a 3D porous framework in chiral space group P3121 with two distinct 1D helical channels along the c axis."
